# API workspace

The FastAPI modular monolith will begin with the M1 constituent/profile vertical slice. Do not create placeholder business routes merely to make this directory look complete.

When M1 begins, add `pyproject.toml`, application configuration, health endpoint, migration configuration, and the constituent module together with its tests and documentation.
